@startuml start-page
title Start Page Target Feature Flow

' Purpose: Show the planned main spot-check flow for the future start page.

actor User
participant "Start Page" as StartPage
participant "Spot Selector" as SpotSelector
participant "Species Selector" as SpeciesSelector
participant "Readiness Result" as ReadinessResult

User -> StartPage: Open start page
StartPage --> User: Show saved spots, spot entry, and supported species choices

alt User has a saved spot
  User -> SpotSelector: Choose saved spot
  SpotSelector --> StartPage: Selected spot context
else User wants a new spot
  User -> SpotSelector: Enter coordinates or choose map location
  note right of User
  Current position can be added later
  as a lower-priority entry path.
  end note
  SpotSelector --> StartPage: Selected spot context
end

User -> SpeciesSelector: Choose mushroom species for the spot
SpeciesSelector --> StartPage: Selected species context

StartPage -> ReadinessResult: Request readiness for selected spot and species

alt Readiness data is available
  ReadinessResult --> StartPage: Readiness label, probability, confidence, and seasonal state
  StartPage --> User: Show main result and short explanation
  StartPage --> User: Offer path to deeper weather and species explanation
else Readiness data is unavailable
  ReadinessResult --> StartPage: Error or insufficient-data result
  StartPage --> User: Show retry path and explain low-confidence or unavailable result
end

@enduml